{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T15:56:47+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-23T15:56:47+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"SMA Solar Technology AG","sector":"Technology","industry":"Solar","country":"Germany","city":"Niestetal","website":"https://www.sma.de","employees":3653,"summary":"SMA Solar Technology AG, together with its subsidiaries, develops, produces, and sells PV and battery inverters, monitoring systems for PV systems, and charging solutions for electric vehicles in Germany and internationally. The company operates in two segments: Home & Business Solutions and Large Scale & Project Solutions. It offers solar and battery inverters, hybrid inverters, system solutions and packages, solar batteries, e-mobility charging solutions, energy management solutions, SMA echarger and commercial storage solutions, and Sunny Tripower X, as well as digital solutions to design, operate, and service PV systems and energy systems. The company serves electric utility companies, independent power producers, project developers and institutional investors, EPCs, system integrators, and grid operators, as well as energy-intensive industries. The company was formerly known as SMA Technologie AG and changed its name to SMA Solar Technology AG in June 2008. SMA Solar Technology AG was founded in 1981 and is headquartered in Niestetal, Germany.","exchange":"XETRA","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"SMA Solar Technology AG, avec ses filiales, développe, produit et vend des onduleurs photovoltaïques et de batterie, des systèmes de surveillance pour les systèmes photovoltaïques et des solutions de charge pour les véhicules électriques en Allemagne et à l'international. La société opère dans deux segments: Home & Business Solutions et Large Scale & Project Solutions. Il propose des onduleurs solaires et de batteries, des onduleurs hybrides, des solutions et d